{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_05",
  "title": "多萝西的承诺",
  "storyCode": "DV-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5713db9837ac4bcb762f80b9cbe3749446e704fed808cd5324c6d93000729702",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g3_cottage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“嗨，玛丽，我有多久没给你写信了？抱歉，在那件事之后，我总是提不起跟你说话的勇气。\n昨天我一整夜没睡，脑子里乱七八糟的，都是小时候的回忆。\n还记得你十五岁生日那天，我们一起偷偷爬到了中央城区那座大法官雕像的肩膀上。\n你开玩笑说，这是违法行为，等你当上警察之后，你随时都能把我逮捕。\n而我说......我说了什么？\n‘每一个人都应有被公平正义支撑的权利。’\n那时候的我，一定没有想过几年后自己会在哪里。\n文明是脆弱的。离开移动城市以后，人和驮兽的区别越来越小。\n今天的我，早就忘了如何谈论公平，每一天占据我大脑的就只有生存而已。\n是的，我变成了你和过去的我最讨厌的那类人。\n（大量划掉的痕迹）\n如果我还有机会回到文明的怀抱中呢？如果我还有机会做回过去的自己呢？\n再过一周就是你的生日，你不知道我有多想给你一个惊喜。\n（大片空白后接潦草得多的字迹）\n他们在拿我们做危险的实验。我能做的只有努力活下去。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g5_laboratory"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领、领队，你看我们射出去的箭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......停在了半空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "射向她和各处仪器的箭矢就像被一面看不见的墙挡住了，再无法前进。\n奇怪的是，它们也并没有弹开。\n就如同有无数无形的手将这些锋利的铁器轻柔地握在了掌心。\n多萝西抬起一只手，指尖轻轻触碰了一下其中一支箭。\n箭头发出嗡的一声轻响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卧倒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领队，这怎么回事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "整齐划一的铁器坠地声传来。\n全部的箭矢都落到了地面上，但落到地面上的并不是箭矢的全部。每一支箭的箭头都消失了，取而代之的是一个极为整齐的切面。\n不，它们不是消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜，你也听到刚才那声轻响了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是金属极快振动时发出的响动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些箭头是被震碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们这位弗兰克斯主任......她的源石技艺有多强？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不完全是源石技艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是她的技术，她可是源石技艺应用领域的专家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拓荒者们伤不到她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形状奇特的物体",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_533_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说得对。比起担心她，我更应该担心一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保护好乔伊丝，她的状态依旧很不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有桑尼他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......燃烧瓶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全都拿出来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扔出去，不要瞄准一个地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形状奇特的物体",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_533_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......不愿意听我的话呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的不想看到你们受伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这句话......你怎么......不对其他被你骗到实验台上的人说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没有骗他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们很安全......非常安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要实验成功了，他们就再也不用面对危险的荒野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑尼，这不也是你的愿望吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形状奇特的物体",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_533_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领队，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨姆......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领队......哈......桑尼，逃吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带着活下来的人，离开这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逃到......荒野上......这些大公司......追不上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荒野......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我们是......拓荒者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈哈！他们害怕荒野，我们......才不怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "要逃吗？\n从这里转身出去，放弃其他同伴，放弃要一个答案。\n这样能活下去。这不就是自己唯一想要的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g3_cottage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑尼，你在写什么......写信？哈哈，难道说城里还有人在等你的信吗？你这个幸运的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不定......这会变成证据。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么证据？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让外面的人知道我们的遭遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为我们只是去救迪克他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "万一失败了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想留下点什么。萨姆，就算我们都活不成了，我也想别人知道，我们曾经挣扎过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g5_laboratory"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他当然想活下去。\n但他更想让所有人听见自己的叫喊声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凭什么我们的机会......只能等着你们来给？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不公平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他在地上摸到了一支箭。\n箭头被磨平了，没关系，他还有手。\n矿石病给他带来了这么多噩运，唯有一点，它也让他拥有了一点点力量。\n跟厉害角色们相比或许微不足道，却足以把这根箭折成两半。\n尖锐的截面能够成为武器，帮他解决眼前的敌人，为他打破这强加于他身上的桎梏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别再往前走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "断箭在他手中失去了控制，紧跟着是他的手。\n一股看不见的巨大力量钳住了他的手腕，逼迫他停下脚步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的研究从来就不该被拿来对付你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它最初被设计出来，是为了让你们能轻松地对付荒地上的野兽，越过艰险的地形障碍，在天灾面前争取逃生机会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是为了保护你们啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说什么......保护......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你问过我们的意愿了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他要前进，越是有人压着他，他就越要前进。\n箭的断面磨破了他的掌心，越来越多的鲜血淌下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放弃吧，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的回答是，我不愿意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "基地那边的情况如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "防卫科的人刚发来了最新消息，到目前为止，没有人离开基地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......按照计划，多萝西的“中枢”理应完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜有没有发来消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "截止到上次通讯的时间点，她并未抵达监控站，与防卫科的人员会合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先回去，把最新一批递质替我准备好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，您需要多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三分之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留给莱茵生命的时间不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实验很顺利，上校先生。只差最后一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们等不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维多利亚剧变的余波至今仍冲击着每一个国家。我们的对手和朋友都在为此准备着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那样的武器——极有可能仍掌握在某一方政治实体手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是他们率先对我们的任意一座城市发起攻击，转瞬之间，哥伦比亚过去百年的努力都会付诸流水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会回到阴云的遮蔽之下，受到其他国家的钳制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我们必须拥有比他们更先进的技术......能够跨越距离，精准地将我们的武器送到任意地点的技术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，哥伦比亚需要“导航”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很聪明，克鲁尼，而且你比一般的聪明人要务实得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等这次交易完成，我们很期待与莱茵生命的新总辖达成更多合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信我，上校，我比您更期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫更多人去实验室打包试剂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我需要全部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g5_laboratory"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......这些家伙真难对付......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形状奇特的物体",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_533_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一路上都看见了，我的法术可不如格雷伊的实用啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我们验证了无数次，这种液体结构非常难破坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有更坏的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有没有提过？我们头顶......整个实验区，存储了更多同种物质......总体积是我们面前这些的上万倍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也许你真该早点说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说它们是实验的副产品，那实验的主要目的到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一种新的替代传统施术单元的技术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能量科负责的就是你看到的这种特殊物质的研发。它对微振动非常敏感，能够充当......接收并编码神经信号的媒介。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们管它叫“递质”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理想情况下，它能让源石技艺适应性普通的人摇身一变成为优秀的术师......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......就连副产品......都能造成这么大的......威胁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奥利维亚，我实在没办法一边战斗一边做学术报告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有时候我也挺想要一个乔伊丝脑袋里的装置的，这样的话，我脑子里的念头一动，你就能接收到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那好，我换一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要如何才能停下这个实验？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白你为这个实验付出了很多的心血，也明白你对多萝西的感情，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，奥利维亚，你再念下去都快让我想起姐姐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个项目对我来说很重要，可多萝西的状态明显不对......我是那种连轻重缓急都分不清的人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是需要......唔......好好想一想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来这里的次数还是太少，要是当初再多缠一会多萝西就好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......施术者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜，假设我们眼前的就是源石技艺造物，那施术者在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "控制它们的并不像是多萝西。它们只是陪伴在她身边而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些消失的拓荒者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整个实验室里，多萝西最不想让我们靠近的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜，瞄准她身后——施放你的源石技艺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最大功率的那种，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "璀璨星光从半空倾泻而下，虽然只有短短一瞬间，但足以夺去所有人的目光。\n——包括那些银色的形状奇特的物体，假如它们的确有“眼睛”的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形状奇特的物体",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_533_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不能去那里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜，你不该这样做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站、站不住......怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手和脚都好像不是自己的了......啊啊！这仪器有多贵？不管了，先抓着再说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止我们，拓荒者们也都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领队，是地震了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坚持住！"
    },
