    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "电自己一下原来真的有用，至少恢复了短暂的知觉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......电？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "电流能短暂干扰的源石技艺效果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚才说......这项研究的基础核心是振动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙粒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实验室里到处都是沙粒，我们身上也是......因为太细小了所以很难注意到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜，继续找受试者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去阻止多萝西。"
