    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您竟然打算亲自去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我说得不够明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，只是我还以为那边人够多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我，为什么越是突破性的研究越需要重复多次实验？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为怕出错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为关键的结果必须要绝对可靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弗兰克斯主任......不可信任吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多萝西？情感给予了她强大的动力，令她创造出了惊人的成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但过于丰富的情感在关键时刻也可能会变成她的软肋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还有埃琳娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我比你更希望她能尽快成长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的成就动机很强烈，可经历过的事还太少。没有我的提醒，她未必能做出最合适的决策。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾，整个莱茵生命，最可靠的人只有我自己。"
