      "text": "咳......咳咳，你好，弗兰克斯主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎么移动到我面前的？我以为振动膜会阻断你的四肢的神经信号传导。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是医生，我对人类的身体比你还要熟悉一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我让你们很难受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再过一会就好，实验就快成功了，到那时候，我会立即解除你们的行动限制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......然后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那之后的成功，真的能抵消此刻的伤害吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看那些正在挣扎的人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家别......放弃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉住......拉住我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当眼里只有未来的时候，人会选择性忽视眼前正在发生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的人，我在莱茵生命见过很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是弗兰克斯主任......多萝西，你和他们并不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当你注视着桑尼和其余拓荒者的时候，你的眼睛里有泪光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能感受他们的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......这一时的痛苦，和永无止境的痛苦，究竟哪一种更让人无法忍受呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默医生，他们的人生陷进了泥沼里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想拉住他们，想让他们得到我和你曾经拥有的机会——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当一个正在挣扎的溺水之人感觉到有人在拉扯他，他很有可能挣扎得更厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这真的是拒绝吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泥水封住了他们的口舌，可我能听见他们的求救声，我伸出了手，更不会在即将抓住他们的时候松开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而你必须停下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的无人机？什么时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你说话的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弗兰克斯主任，在离开莱茵生命之后，我去过很多地方，有一些环境比你这漫天沙子的实验室更恶劣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时刻保持医疗器械的洁净是战地医生的必修课。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多萝西......果然不肯放弃啊，谁让她也这么死脑筋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（手麻得更厉害了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（再电一下吗？唉，再电下去我的手腕神经都要废了吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "光？我的法术吗？乔伊丝，以前的你可没这么喜欢我的魔术表演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星星......很亮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在远方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在看哪里......告诉我，你到底在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是你在看什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而是......你知道什么......你是不是得到了一些我和奥利维亚感受不到的信息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在光里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么......动起来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你本来就失去了意识......所以振动膜对你没有那么大影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你指的方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也是所有银色造物聚集的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道消失的人们在哪里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快看，领队，那里有一扇门打开了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "门......开了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，小心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "所有振动都停止了。\n银色造物瞬间分解，化作一摊摊毫无威胁的液体。\n多萝西停下了动作，即便赫默的无人机正抵着她的后颈，她也没有反抗。\n她的眼睛里只有那扇门，还有门后的一切。\n那是她发誓要保护的，也是她背负着的她和无数人的梦想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
